                                "sense_id": "3e199c6c-4694-31f4-a6eb-19f441ed96cf",
                                "text": "\"The pigs is well,\" said Mr. Squeers, \"the cows is well, and the boys is bobbish. Young Sprouter has been a-winking, has he? I'll wink him when I get back.\""
